mailman: Hey, hey, hey, how ya doin pal?
mailman: How're ya settlin' down here?
- Fine
	jump timeline/good
- Alright
	jump timeline/good
- Horribly
	jump timeline/horrible
label good
mailman: That's great!
mailman: Seeing how it's so different from the big city out here i was expecting you to have a tough time
jump timeline/work start
label horrible
mailman: Well, i suppose it's to be expected
mailman: But what can ya do?
mailman: You'll get used to it
jump timeline/work start
label work start
mailman: Alright, lemme show ya how you deal with letters
[signal arg="letter_spawn"]
mailman: We'll be working with these a lot
mailman: Try dragging it around, get a feel for it \
(Hold Left Click and drag)
[wait time="10.0" skippable="true"]
if {letter_moved} == 2.0:
	mailman: good.. good..
	mailman: now you should try stamping it